{
  "epId": 7000,
  "name": "「沃陆之邦」",
  "desc": "<p>纳塔的六部族之一，也称为特特奥坎。该部族的人与突角龙共同生活。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/34cbc5aa060896e731bea85173816bed_7493845042385634080.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1762420707,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名成员"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "阿霍布\n部落的创始人，曾与初代火神，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7074,
        "name": "希巴拉克",
        "desc": "<p>曾击败「焰主」，并于烈焰中复活的初代火神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/326985891/e7f7eee058f60fc225b1f5bc654a08e0_644236905823485778.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "并肩作战，后来加入",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7296,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的队伍对龙族赶尽杀绝。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7493,
        "name": "万杰鲁",
        "desc": "<p>纳塔的六英杰之一，继承古名「<custom-ruby data-ruby=\"乌|力|威|量|佐\"></custom-ruby>」。她于五百年前灾变中牺牲。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/25/326985891/add3afe4552cceed035952468c67b943_1718231355735203536.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "火神玛薇卡的好友，也是部族的英雄，她于500年前",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间加入特诺切并前往未来的烬寂海。\n菲耶蒂娜\n生活于500年前的一位面具英雄，也是万杰鲁的弟子。\n科潘\n龙遗物研究协会会长，于490年前前往",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7288,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "寻找「回还之玉」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7616,
        "name": "阿卡特",
        "desc": "<p>沃陆之邦的首领。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/3c4e834b8214223748fa1affcd859df1_1166868643092834171.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部落首领",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7502,
        "name": "伊安珊",
        "desc": "沃陆之邦健身俱乐部的总教练，闻名纳塔的营养师。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/25/dd9a200a86b792fb1b73ef1ee7de0911_2097378734184941134.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "健身教练。她是沃陆之邦的英雄，其古名\n也被认可。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7488,
        "name": "瓦雷莎",
        "desc": "悠悠哉哉，无比松弛的「沃陆之邦」战士兼果园主，喜欢充满力量的英雄，还有巨量美食！",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/25/a54efe1bb7e82a589b9af44683a696ca_8635138146175164187.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "来自沃陆之邦的坚韧战士兼果园主。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7594,
        "name": "幼突角龙",
        "desc": "年幼的突角龙，因无法完全掌控身躯的力量而有些笨拙。<br>第二对副角并未生长完全，背部与腹部的力量也没有到能够摧毁挡路岩石的程度。但只要能够茁壮成长，总有能够在沃土平原之上自由驰骋的时刻吧。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/d4641f53018c758c23c0787c0da3ea09_8200080940668319754.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7595,
        "name": "突角龙",
        "desc": "拥有坚硬的冠骨和强大身躯力量，能够在火山四周的原野上飞速疾驰的龙。<br>传说中，原本的突角龙具有堪称庞大的形体，甚至可以用角顶着山峰进行移动，只不过行动远不如当今这样灵敏。或许如今突角龙身躯里所具备的那种力量，也是一种血脉之中的遗留。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/21204af0a9d126a19e69744fcd9d8e28_8528916191906861743.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部落的伙伴\n火山大王\n一只黑色与紫色相间、身体如同蝾螈一样的巨大怪物。它夺取了力量在它的祖先，龙王修库特尔死后。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "地区"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7421,
