        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7529,
        "name": "青绛曜石断片",
        "desc": "在探索时偶然得到的，刻画有「沃陆之邦」风格纹饰的黑曜石断片。看上去只要有如是三个就能够组成一个完整的环，但不知道有什么作用。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/a203e6a28213723cc8bdc49bb7001691_650881088968368608.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7530,
        "name": "青绛曜石环",
        "desc": "刻画有「沃陆之邦」风格纹饰的黑曜石环，是部族与深沉夜晚建立联系所用的古老媒介，或许可以凭借它的力量跨越某处的边界…",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/092cdef9de8592cad0a539a6785595ed_7542256556951226545.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7525,
        "name": "声望经验·「沃陆之邦」",
        "desc": "提升「沃陆之邦」部族声望等级。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/173ee33603e025511b35b82dada65532_3722125780266675709.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7549,
        "name": "丰稔之赐",
        "desc": "以颗粒果为主的菜肴。将碎肉馅炒熟，放在烤盘上，添上肉块与蛋，最后铺上搅碎的颗粒果糊糊，送入烤箱，直至颜色变得诱人。这道用料丰厚的菜肴，通常会在庆祝大丰收之时被端上「沃陆之邦」的餐桌。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/045a675a36c837f54e10668d9ebc94a3_4114459208384579484.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画与预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》部族短片 -「沃陆之邦疾走环游」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/65bf9ef6b7d9e7a058e35f5926214e83_970903716617969492.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年3月14日</color>\n沃陆之邦的成员们饱含对运动与奔跑的热忱，\n似乎这里的每寸土地每个角落，似乎这里的每寸土地每个角落。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=gB4cNeiCY6I"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "「沃陆之邦」观光团，出发！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/03/17/237301566/e0823620d4eb6e73e7bc8733e8f3c80e_4703114352242628201.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年3月17日</color>\n旅行者好呀~\n欢迎来到坐落于火山脚下，崇尚力量的部族——「沃陆之邦」！收拾好行囊，跟随临时向导的步伐，一起参观这片丰藏与耕种的沃野，感受这里独特的风土人情吧！"
      }
    ],
